  function listeningPayload(params,submissionId){const p=new URLSearchParams(params);const entries=['entry.1101074174','entry.1320743073','entry.838708618','entry.950878529'];if(entries.some(k=>p.get(k)===null||p.get(k).trim()===''))throw failure('INVALID_SCORE','Điểm bài nghe chưa đầy đủ.');return {source:'ielts-listening-submit',version:1,action:'submitListening',submissionId,student:{name:p.get('entry.442430322'),className:p.get('entry.55126249')},week:p.get('entry.1893665426'),scores:entries.map(k=>Number(p.get(k))) };}
  function enqueue(value){let payload;try{payload=clone(value)}catch(_){return Promise.reject(failure('INVALID_REQUEST','Dữ liệu bài nộp không hợp lệ.'))}return ready.then(async()=>{const id=recordKey(payload);if(!id)throw failure('INVALID_REQUEST','Thiếu mã bài nộp.');const canonical=stable(payload);let record=records.get(id);if(record&&record.canonical!==canonical)throw failure('SUBMISSION_PAYLOAD_CHANGED','Lượt này đã có bản nộp trước đó. Hệ thống giữ nguyên bản nộp đầu tiên.');if(!record){record={version:2,submissionId:id,payload,canonical,status:'pending',createdAt:Date.now(),updatedAt:Date.now(),revision:revision(),attempts:0};records.set(id,record);await persist(record);notify(record);schedule();}return clone(record);});}
  root.IELTSSubmission={version:2,ready,send,enqueue,async discardRejected(submissionId){await ready;const record=records.get(submissionId);if(record?.status==='blocked'&&['INVALID_REQUEST','INVALID_JSON','INVALID_SOURCE','INVALID_ORIGIN','INVALID_REQUEST_ID','INVALID_NONCE','INVALID_ACTION','INVALID_ASSIGNMENT','INVALID_SUBMISSION_ID','INVALID_ANSWERS','INCOMPLETE_ANSWERS','INVALID_ELAPSED','INVALID_STUDENT'].includes(record.error?.code)){record.dismissed=true;await persist(record);paint();return true;}return false;},subscribe(listener){listeners.add(listener);return()=>listeners.delete(listener);},async lookup(submissionId){await ready;const record=records.get(submissionId);return record?clone(record):null;},async listening(params,submissionId){return send(listeningPayload(params,submissionId));},async enqueueListening(params,submissionId){return enqueue(listeningPayload(params,submissionId));}};
